# Doc Flip Video Generator

Generate flip-page animation videos from JSON configurations.

## Project Structure

- `article.json` — Content configuration
- `template.json` — Visual style
- `src/build.mjs` — Main entry point
- `src/gen-pages.mjs` — Image generation
- `src/capture.mjs` — Video rendering
- `src/renderer.html` — WebGL shaders

## Key Commands

```bash
npm run build                    # Generate video
node src/build.mjs <config.json> # Custom config
npm run demo                     # Browser preview
```

## Configuration

Edit `article.json` with:
- `meta` — Document metadata
- `cover` — Cover page content
- `content` — Main content with highlights
- `timing` — Animation timing

## Paragraphs

- `{ "text": "...", "bold": true }` — Bold red text
- `{ "text": "...", "highlight": "keyword" }` — Highlighted text

## Requirements

- Node.js ≥ 18
- ffmpeg
- Chinese fonts
